         <photoshop:TextLayers>
            <rdf:Bag>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>The Meditations</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>The Meditations</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>I present to you an offering of three meditations which will in</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>I present to you an offering of three meditations which will introduce you to connecting with your internal world and create your own safe sacred space.  Each meditation is around 10 minutes long, fully guided, space held and opportunity for reï¬‚ections afterwards. Beginning with creating your sacred space, exploring introspection and receiving, these themes have been crafted to open up and hold a space for you to lean into and be supported in your inward journey.  Even if meditation is new to you, or you've been meditating for many years, each and every experience is unique; allowing for something new to arise within. An opportunity to lay a foundation, build upon existing ones and empower yourself to hold a strong unity and fortress within.</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>AmyGrist.com</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>AmyGrist.com</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
            </rdf:Bag>
         </photoshop:TextLayers>
