                  <photoshop:LayerName>The Meditations</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>The Meditations</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Before listening to these guided meditations, I invite you to s</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Before listening to these guided meditations, I invite you to spend 2-5 minutes in a meditative posture (sitting, or laying down) and see what sort of questions arise from this gentle experience. Allow your mind to be free and honour what comes.  After each meditation, sitting for some moments in reï¬‚ection is recommended. Having a pen and paper handy to record your thoughts, feelings and experiences invites the experience to be fully realised. It can also allow things to arise you didn't know were there! </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>A series of guided meditations to create  and cultivate your in</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>A series of guided meditations to create  and cultivate your inner sacred space</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
